## solutions

#### breadth first

```cpp
#include <queue>
#include <string>

std::string bottomRightValue(Node* root) {
  std::queue<Node*> queue;
  queue.push(root);
  Node* current;
  while (queue.size() > 0) {
    current = queue.front();
    queue.pop();


    if (current->left != nullptr) {
      queue.push(current->left);
    }

    if (current->right != nullptr) {
      queue.push(current->right);
    }
  }

  return current->val;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
